.TH CASSETTE 1 "2026-11-24" "cassette 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cassette \- terminal music and video player
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcassette\fR [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
cassette is a terminal music and video player with an mpv video backend.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmpv\fR(1)
